# Per-developer iOS device signing. `device/` holds a local_provisioning_profile
# pointing at a credential minted against someone's Apple Developer account, so
# the directory is created from the committed device.example/ template and never
# checked in. See e2e/iroh_demo/device.example/BUILD.bazel.example.
e2e/*/device/

